<http://data.silknow.org/object/34d5b176-89de-3fee-8e85-d31f84037b5f>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "Infinite Variety" , "June 17 - September 18, 2005" , "The eye-dazzling effects of the ziggurat shapes in this quilt are intensified by the placement of plain and patterned fabrics throughout the individual cells. Although each cell is symmetrically patterned, color alternation creates channels and swirls of color that impart a restless motion to the overall design. The contrast between the symmetry of the piecing and the symmetry breaking in the color use contributes to a balanced but not static composition." ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/b182fe49-1dd8-34c5-8b17-137ddde73915> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    "Exhibition" ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "June 17 - September 18, 2005" , "The eye-dazzling effects of the ziggurat shapes in this quilt are intensified by the placement of plain and patterned fabrics throughout the individual cells. Although each cell is symmetrically patterned, color alternation creates channels and swirls of color that impart a restless motion to the overall design. The contrast between the symmetry of the piecing and the symmetry breaking in the color use contributes to a balanced but not static composition." , "Infinite Variety" ;
        schema:contentUrl   <https://risdmuseum.org/exhibitions-events/exhibitions/infinite-variety> .

